WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.384
[MUSIC]

00:00:07.384 --> 00:00:10.350
MICHAEL SANDEL: In many countries
the debate over same sex marriage

00:00:10.350 --> 00:00:13.048
stirs strong passions.

00:00:13.048 --> 00:00:15.684
Underlying this debate
are competing views

00:00:15.684 --> 00:00:19.124
about the moral status
of same sex unions

00:00:19.128 --> 00:00:22.613
and also an important question
about the role of the state.

00:00:22.613 --> 00:00:25.771
Which of the following three
policies toward marriage

00:00:25.771 --> 00:00:28.136
do you think the state should adopt?

00:00:28.136 --> 00:00:32.159
A, recognize only marriages
between a man and a woman,

00:00:32.159 --> 00:00:37.883
B, recognize marriage between gay
couples as well as straight couples,

00:00:37.883 --> 00:00:41.373
or C, don't recognize
marriage of any kind,

00:00:41.373 --> 00:00:46.615
but leave this role to religious
institutions and private associations.

00:00:46.615 --> 00:00:50.685
[MUSIC]

